---
xps_name: ssb
outcome: t2dm
lag: 4
distribution: lognormal
source: Micha et al. (https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2017.0947), Huang et al. (https://doi.org/10.1161/CIRCULATIONAHA.118.036751)
notes: 
    - Adjusted for BMI 
    - RRs are presented per 8 oz ~ 227 ml ~ 20 grams of sugar (We use sugar)
    - ssb_rr := ssb_rr ^ ((ssb_lagged / 20) 
apply_rr_extra_fn: >
  function(sp) {
    if (!inherits(sp, 'SynthPop')) stop('Argument sp needs to be a SynthPop object.')
    sp$pop[, ssb_rr := clamp(ssb_rr^(ssb/ 20), 1, 20)]
  }
